The FIFA World Cup is an international football tournament held every four years.
The most recent World Cup was held in 2022 in Qatar.
Argentina won the 2022 FIFA World Cup.
Lionel Messi was one of the standout players of the tournament.
France was the runner-up, losing to Argentina in the final.
The next World Cup will be held in 2026 and will be hosted jointly by the United States, Canada, and Mexico.
